# GimbalVideoControl's own menu and its keys and clicks: Mini map, Swap with map, Yaw Lock, the
# keys and a click reaching the vehicle, and Settings.
#
# The claim: Mini map is CheckOnClick; unchecked it hides the map and Swap with map, checked it
# shows both (FlightData.cs:6547-6551). Swap with map is Mini from full sized and Full Sized from
# the mini video (6552-6562). A click on the picture focuses it (GimbalVideoControl.cs:609-612);
# with the focus the keys steer: Alt+F takes a picture - IMAGE_START_CAPTURE to the camera, which
# needs no capability (459-511, CameraProtocol.cs:397-409); W held is a pitch rate the manager has
# not said it can do, so nothing is sent, and let go the zero rates, which need no axis, are sent
# as DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW (397-457, GimbalManagerProtocol.cs:273-294). L toggles the yaw lock,
# which Yaw Lock shows checked (477-479, 528-535). The plain left click is Click Pan/Tilt, which
# needs the gimbal's reported attitude: SITL has none, so nothing goes (622-640). Settings opens
# GimbalControlSettingsForm with each preference's binding; Slew Left pressed listens, J is taken,
# and Save keeps it as the control's preference (GimbalControlSettingsForm.cs:19-170,
# KeyBindingButton.cs:83-163, GimbalVideoControl.cs:755-763).
#
# Needs SITL (a copter: a gimbal manager and a camera object, no gimbal):
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-gimbal-video-control.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen fly
window 1600x1200
budget 19

expect vehicle.count > 0
click fly-tab-actions
expect fly.tab tabActions
click fly-gimbalvideo-full
expect fly.gimbal.video full
expect fly.gimbal.map mini

# Mini map unchecked: the map and Swap with map hidden; checked again, both back.
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
expect fly.gimbal.menu true
click fly-gimbal-menu-minimap
expect fly.gimbal.minimap false
expect fly.gimbal.map hidden
expect fly.gimbal.items minimap,close
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
click fly-gimbal-menu-minimap
expect fly.gimbal.minimap true
expect fly.gimbal.map mini
expect fly.gimbal.items minimap,swap,close

# Swap with map: the mini video, then full sized again.
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
click fly-gimbal-menu-swap
expect fly.gimbal.video mini
expect fly.gimbal.map full
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
click fly-gimbal-menu-swap
expect fly.gimbal.video full
expect fly.gimbal.map mini

# A click on the picture: the focus, and Click Pan/Tilt, which has no attitude to start from.
click fly-gimbal-video-box
expect fly.gimbal.command SetAttitudeAsync: not sent (no attitude)

# The keys: Alt+F takes a picture.
key alt+f
expect fly.gimbal.command ~ TakeSinglePictureAsync: COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_IMAGE_START_CAPTURE
# W pressed and let go: the zero rates go out.
key w
expect fly.gimbal.held none
expect fly.gimbal.command ~ SetRatesCommandAsync: COMMAND_LONG MAV_CMD_DO_GIMBAL_MANAGER_PITCHYAW
# L: the yaw lock, which the menu shows.
expect fly.gimbal.yawlock false
key l
expect fly.gimbal.yawlock true
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
click fly-gimbal-menu-yawlock
expect fly.gimbal.yawlock false

# Settings: Slew Left listens, J taken, Save keeps it.
expect fly.gimbal.pref.SlewLeft A
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
click fly-gimbal-menu-settings
expect fly.gimbal.settings true
expect fly.gimbal.settings.SlewLeft A
click fly-gimbal-settings-SlewLeft
expect fly.gimbal.settings.listening SlewLeft
key j
expect fly.gimbal.settings.listening none
expect fly.gimbal.settings.SlewLeft J
click fly-gimbal-settings-save
expect fly.gimbal.settings false
expect fly.gimbal.pref.SlewLeft J
